/doc/helpdir/who
================
 
SYNTAX
======
 
who [<sort>]
 
DESCRIPTION
===========
 
"who"      shows everyone on at that time.
"who play" shows all players on at that time.
"who wiz"  shows all Wizards on at that time.
"who died" shows all ghosts on at that time.
"who new"  shows all the newbies on at that time.
